WEBVTT

00:11.340 --> 00:13.340
<b>[flames crackling]</b>

00:16.010 --> 00:18.010
<b>[rhythmic, brooding music plays]</b>

00:20.930 --> 00:21.930
<b>Hmm.</b>

00:25.270 --> 00:27.810
<b>They've taken our town, our homes.</b>

00:27.900 --> 00:30.940
<b>Now we show them what they can never take.</b>

00:31.030 --> 00:32.070
<b>[all] Yeah!</b>

00:32.650 --> 00:35.570
<b>At least
one of you had better survive this.</b>

00:35.660 --> 00:37.320
<b>I still need to get paid.</b>

00:37.950 --> 00:41.700
<b>I fear your hope for remittance
rests entirely on Saki now</b>

00:41.790 --> 00:43.120
<b>and her protector.</b>

00:51.960 --> 00:52.960
<b>[wind whistling]</b>

01:03.310 --> 01:04.770
<b>[Yasuke] Azuchi Castle.</b>

01:10.570 --> 01:12.480
<b>["Black Gold" by Flying Lotus plays]</b>

01:12.570 --> 01:16.030
<b>♪ Brought in a world ♪</b>

01:16.700 --> 01:22.200
<b>♪ World so brand new
Endless possibilities ♪</b>

01:23.500 --> 01:27.370
<b>♪ A whole new identity ♪</b>

01:27.870 --> 01:30.130
<b>♪ Can't you see? ♪</b>

01:30.880 --> 01:34.710
<b>♪ Black gold of the sun ♪</b>

01:34.800 --> 01:37.470
<b>♪ Open up your eyes ♪</b>

01:37.550 --> 01:40.140
<b>♪ Open up your heart ♪</b>

01:40.220 --> 01:43.060
<b>♪ And feel the sunshine ♪</b>

01:43.140 --> 01:45.480
<b>♪ Black diamond ♪</b>

01:45.980 --> 01:48.650
<b>♪ I just want to be ♪</b>

01:48.730 --> 01:51.400
<b>♪ Where I'm supposed to be ♪</b>

01:52.440 --> 01:55.070
<b>♪ And that's right here with you ♪</b>

02:06.960 --> 02:11.670
<b>♪ Don't mistake my kindness for weakness ♪</b>

02:11.750 --> 02:14.420
<b>♪ 'Cause I'm strong, you see ♪</b>

02:14.500 --> 02:17.470
<b>♪ Stronger than you'll ever be ♪</b>

02:19.430 --> 02:21.850
<b>♪ Loyal to me ♪</b>

02:21.930 --> 02:24.760
<b>♪ Someone to call my friend ♪</b>

02:24.850 --> 02:27.680
<b>♪ Whenever you need me ♪</b>

02:27.770 --> 02:30.520
<b>♪ I'll be right here ♪</b>

02:30.600 --> 02:32.900
<b>♪ Love and loyalty ♪</b>

02:33.400 --> 02:35.980
<b>♪ Trust and honesty ♪</b>

02:37.110 --> 02:39.610
<b>♪ I'll never let go ♪</b>

02:58.800 --> 03:00.050
<b>It's time.</b>

03:00.130 --> 03:02.470
<b>[rapid percussive music plays]</b>

03:05.560 --> 03:07.470
<b>You would abandon your position?</b>

03:10.060 --> 03:11.350
<b>This is your plan?</b>

03:11.440 --> 03:14.980
<b>Let us all get overrun
while you pray for your own salvation?</b>

03:15.900 --> 03:16.980
<b>[grunts]</b>

03:17.940 --> 03:19.320
<b>[energy blasting]</b>

03:19.820 --> 03:20.650
<b>Hmm!</b>

03:21.990 --> 03:23.410
<b>[otherworldly clashing]</b>

03:23.490 --> 03:24.990
<b>-[rumbling]
-[man grunts]</b>

03:25.660 --> 03:30.330
<b>[Morisuke] Your spiritual power is great,
but you use it only as a weapon,</b>

03:30.410 --> 03:33.580
<b>even when it would be better used
as a shield.</b>

03:35.540 --> 03:37.210
<b>[whooshing]</b>

03:37.300 --> 03:38.460
<b>[crying out]</b>

03:39.210 --> 03:41.470
<b>There's a saying among my people, Doctor.</b>

03:41.550 --> 03:43.550
<b>"No matter how hard the shield,</b>

03:43.640 --> 03:46.300
<b>with enough time,
any blade will get through it."</b>

03:46.800 --> 03:50.060
<b>-How do we get through all this?
-Stay here.</b>

03:50.140 --> 03:53.480
<b>-That's the opposite of getting through.
-You stay here.</b>

03:54.060 --> 03:55.100
<b>[Saki yelps]</b>

04:00.440 --> 04:01.440
<b>[thudding]</b>

04:02.950 --> 04:04.110
<b>[Yasuke straining]</b>

04:04.200 --> 04:05.910
<b>[crackling]</b>

04:05.990 --> 04:07.990
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

04:10.250 --> 04:11.250
<b>[boom]</b>

04:12.290 --> 04:13.120
<b>What the hell?</b>

04:13.210 --> 04:16.250
<b>-Ambush! He fights for the enemy!
-Wait. No! Don't shoot!</b>

04:16.330 --> 04:19.710
<b>Hold your fire! It isn't me!
I'm not doing this!</b>

04:21.090 --> 04:22.760
<b>-[Yasuke] Now we go.
-[yelps]</b>

04:25.220 --> 04:27.390
<b>[clamor of battle]</b>

04:30.010 --> 04:31.060
<b>[grunts]</b>

04:34.640 --> 04:35.480
<b>[shouts]</b>

04:36.520 --> 04:37.400
<b>[grunts]</b>

04:37.480 --> 04:38.310
<b>[groans]</b>

04:42.150 --> 04:43.320
<b>[grunting]</b>

04:46.780 --> 04:47.870
<b>-[grunts]
-[clinks]</b>

04:47.950 --> 04:49.370
<b>[all shouting]</b>

04:54.960 --> 04:55.870
<b>[rumbling]</b>

05:06.840 --> 05:08.890
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

05:10.260 --> 05:14.140
<b>[all shouting]</b>

05:18.900 --> 05:19.900
<b>Show-off.</b>

05:25.070 --> 05:26.400
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

05:26.490 --> 05:27.780
<b>-[bang]
-[crash]</b>

05:27.860 --> 05:29.910
<b>[clattering]</b>

05:38.750 --> 05:39.920
<b>[sighs, pants]</b>

05:41.670 --> 05:42.800
<b>Hey, listen.</b>

05:42.880 --> 05:45.050
<b>You'll get to rest soon. I promise.</b>

05:45.130 --> 05:49.010
<b>You just need to keep your strength
for a short while longer. Can you do that?</b>

05:49.090 --> 05:49.930
<b>Mm-hmm.</b>

05:50.010 --> 05:50.890
<b>Good.</b>

05:50.970 --> 05:53.140
<b>Tell me where to find the Daimyo.</b>

05:53.220 --> 05:54.060
<b>Hmm.</b>

05:55.850 --> 05:57.060
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

06:00.150 --> 06:01.860
<b>-[gasps]
-[thrumming]</b>

06:04.230 --> 06:06.360
<b>-Where is she?
-Everywhere.</b>

06:08.280 --> 06:09.740
<b>[crackling]</b>

06:12.200 --> 06:13.580
<b>Ah!</b>

06:17.960 --> 06:18.960
<b>[sharp rippling sound]</b>

06:24.050 --> 06:25.710
<b>[sighs] Hey, what--</b>

06:44.610 --> 06:45.690
<b>[exhales]</b>

06:53.530 --> 06:55.280
<b>[sighs, gasps]</b>

06:57.370 --> 06:59.290
<b>Yassan, are you okay?</b>

07:02.130 --> 07:04.040
<b>-[gasps]
-[snarling]</b>

07:04.630 --> 07:06.630
<b>[energized electronic music plays]</b>

07:07.130 --> 07:09.130
<b>-[snarling]
-[Yasuke grunting]</b>

07:11.220 --> 07:12.720
<b>-[snarls]
-[Yasuke grunts]</b>

07:12.800 --> 07:14.390
<b>-Yassan?
-[grunts]</b>

07:15.560 --> 07:17.390
<b>-Yassan!
-[grunting]</b>

07:18.310 --> 07:19.140
<b>Yassan!</b>

07:19.230 --> 07:22.060
<b>Iga soldiers. What are they doing here?</b>

07:22.150 --> 07:23.860
<b>Wha--? Uh… [sighs]</b>

07:33.740 --> 07:38.120
<b>That always was your way.
To follow your first instinct.</b>

07:38.200 --> 07:39.660
<b>Act from your gut.</b>

07:40.290 --> 07:42.920
<b>[laughs] Come now, my friend.</b>

07:43.000 --> 07:46.000
<b>From that look,
one would think you've never seen a ghost!</b>

07:46.090 --> 07:46.920
<b>[gasps]</b>

07:47.000 --> 07:48.340
<b>Surely you must have known</b>

07:48.420 --> 07:50.840
<b>I wasn't entirely finished
with this world.</b>

07:51.470 --> 07:54.180
<b>Or is it the other way around?</b>

08:00.680 --> 08:01.810
<b>My lord.</b>

08:01.890 --> 08:06.060
<b>I come here to help you defeat the Daimyo
who usurped me.</b>

08:06.150 --> 08:09.070
<b>-[Yasuke, whispering] How?
-[Saki] Who are you talking to?</b>

08:09.150 --> 08:10.230
<b>Come.</b>

08:10.320 --> 08:13.650
<b>Time, as always, fights against us.</b>

08:22.660 --> 08:23.960
<b>[grunts]</b>

08:25.330 --> 08:26.330
<b>What's happening?</b>

08:29.170 --> 08:31.590
<b>[panting]</b>

08:47.190 --> 08:49.190
<b>[breathing heavily]</b>

08:53.690 --> 08:54.860
<b>My lord, you're…</b>

08:55.570 --> 08:56.660
<b>[Nobunaga] Alive?</b>

08:57.160 --> 09:01.910
<b>Matters of such importance
are rarely so cut and dry.</b>

09:05.330 --> 09:07.630
<b>I am still your kaishakunin.</b>

09:07.710 --> 09:08.710
<b>No!</b>

09:08.790 --> 09:11.840
<b>There is only one way
to break these bonds.</b>

09:11.920 --> 09:16.260
<b>Destroy Hojo Masako,
whose power sustains them.</b>

09:16.340 --> 09:18.470
<b>You must free me, Yasuke.</b>

09:18.970 --> 09:21.510
<b>You must kill the Daimyo.</b>

09:23.600 --> 09:24.810
<b>[Saki] Yassan!</b>

09:29.110 --> 09:31.110
<b>I won't just leave you, Yassan.</b>

09:44.450 --> 09:45.660
<b>It's you.</b>

09:48.500 --> 09:51.670
<b>-[whooshing]
-[Saki grunting]</b>

09:52.590 --> 09:55.090
<b>-[jarring clash]
-[screams, panting]</b>

09:55.170 --> 09:56.130
<b>[whoosh]</b>

09:56.220 --> 09:57.720
<b>-[whizz]
-[screams]</b>

09:59.430 --> 10:01.100
<b>[shimmering pulse]</b>

10:04.180 --> 10:06.180
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

10:09.190 --> 10:11.190
<b>[mellow electronic music playing]</b>

10:13.820 --> 10:14.900
<b>It's her.</b>

10:24.990 --> 10:25.830
<b>[screams]</b>

10:25.910 --> 10:26.750
<b>[shouts]</b>

10:26.830 --> 10:28.120
<b>-[rumbling]
-[man] Whoa!</b>

10:28.210 --> 10:32.000
<b>You know how to make a big wall.
I'll give you that.</b>

10:32.080 --> 10:34.250
<b>We have to give them more time.</b>

10:34.340 --> 10:36.670
<b>They need more time.</b>

10:36.760 --> 10:39.050
<b>Something tells me they don't have it.</b>

10:44.600 --> 10:46.180
<b>[groans]</b>

10:46.270 --> 10:47.890
<b>[all shouting]</b>

10:51.230 --> 10:52.150
<b>[Huh?]</b>

10:54.610 --> 10:56.150
<b>[thunderous roar]</b>

10:56.230 --> 10:57.650
<b>[all groaning]</b>

11:01.240 --> 11:02.780
<b>[crackling]</b>

11:02.870 --> 11:04.030
<b>[all shouting]</b>

11:04.120 --> 11:04.950
<b>Steady!</b>

11:07.240 --> 11:08.290
<b>What are you doing?</b>

11:08.870 --> 11:10.830
<b>Now we try my way.</b>

11:10.920 --> 11:13.790
<b>-Mmm.
-[pulsing, supernatural hum]</b>

11:26.310 --> 11:27.430
<b>[rumbling]</b>

11:36.020 --> 11:37.940
<b>[snarls]</b>

11:38.030 --> 11:39.280
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

11:43.110 --> 11:43.950
<b>Stop it!</b>

11:44.030 --> 11:46.330
<b>It's me, Saki! Can't you see me?</b>

11:47.160 --> 11:49.950
<b>He has abandoned you, like they all do.</b>

11:50.040 --> 11:52.790
<b>He cares only for his own ends.</b>

11:52.870 --> 11:54.580
<b>[grunting]</b>

11:54.670 --> 11:58.840
<b>[Daimyo] Just like your parents
when they sold you.</b>

11:58.920 --> 12:00.920
<b>[shimmering sound intensifies]</b>

12:02.130 --> 12:03.470
<b>[gasps] Yasuke!</b>

12:06.550 --> 12:08.180
<b>[both grunt]</b>

12:09.520 --> 12:11.930
<b>-[shimmering sound]
-[Yasuke straining]</b>

12:12.020 --> 12:16.860
<b>[Daimyo] You begin to understand.
There's only one way to stop the samurai.</b>

12:22.190 --> 12:24.530
<b>You must kill him.</b>

12:28.830 --> 12:31.160
<b>Bring your blade down into her heart.</b>

12:31.870 --> 12:34.170
<b>[Daimyo] You do not need him.</b>

12:34.250 --> 12:37.880
<b>End him and set yourself free.</b>

12:40.460 --> 12:41.300
<b>No!</b>

12:43.010 --> 12:44.180
<b>[shattering, tinkling]</b>

12:44.260 --> 12:45.550
<b>[Yasuke grunts]</b>

12:47.260 --> 12:48.510
<b>He's my friend.</b>

12:49.010 --> 12:51.140
<b>[muttering]</b>

12:57.440 --> 12:59.440
<b>Yasuke, don't do this.</b>

13:00.610 --> 13:02.110
<b>No. This…</b>

13:02.190 --> 13:03.240
<b>This isn't real.</b>

13:03.740 --> 13:05.860
<b>It can't be. It's some kind of trick.</b>

13:05.950 --> 13:07.450
<b>It's not a trick.</b>

13:12.540 --> 13:15.120
<b>-[gasps lightly]
-[Natsumaru] It's your own memory.</b>

13:17.750 --> 13:18.750
<b>Natsumaru?</b>

13:21.840 --> 13:22.840
<b>You have honor.</b>

13:23.550 --> 13:27.090
<b>You try to do the right thing,
even when you have to fight yourself.</b>

13:27.890 --> 13:30.470
<b>You helped your friends. Like me.</b>

13:31.350 --> 13:32.680
<b>[Yasuke] You're not--</b>

13:32.770 --> 13:34.140
<b>You're not really here.</b>

13:34.230 --> 13:36.770
<b>Even if there could be forgiveness
for what I've done,</b>

13:36.850 --> 13:38.560
<b>you aren't here to grant it.</b>

13:38.650 --> 13:42.320
<b>"All we can do now is act
as she would have wanted."</b>

13:42.900 --> 13:45.070
<b>"As they would have wanted."</b>

13:45.150 --> 13:47.240
<b>You said that to me once.</b>

13:49.280 --> 13:50.320
<b>[gasps softly]</b>

13:50.830 --> 13:51.950
<b>Kill her.</b>

13:52.030 --> 13:55.250
<b>She's the one
who helped Mitsuhide betray us.</b>

13:55.330 --> 13:57.410
<b>The Hojo Daimyo must die.</b>

13:57.920 --> 13:58.750
<b>Yes.</b>

13:59.250 --> 14:00.500
<b>She must!</b>

14:01.210 --> 14:03.000
<b>[straining]</b>

14:03.090 --> 14:04.840
<b>[laughing]</b>

14:04.920 --> 14:07.760
<b>Did you think that was
the whole of my strategy?</b>

14:07.840 --> 14:12.510
<b>I merely thought to amuse myself
as I turned the girl's power to mine.</b>

14:12.600 --> 14:15.640
<b>But I can just as easily
rip it from her body.</b>

14:17.230 --> 14:19.310
<b>[Saki groans softly]</b>

14:19.400 --> 14:22.270
<b>Are you all right? Did I hurt you?</b>

14:22.360 --> 14:24.020
<b>-No.
-[flames flickering]</b>

14:27.610 --> 14:29.280
<b>[loud crash]</b>

14:31.120 --> 14:33.530
<b>-[hissing]
-[disquieting music plays]</b>

14:34.580 --> 14:35.910
<b>[rumbling]</b>

14:40.710 --> 14:42.710
<b>[high-pitched shrieking]</b>

14:44.630 --> 14:46.050
<b>[Yasuke groans]</b>

14:48.630 --> 14:50.550
<b>[creaking]</b>

14:50.630 --> 14:51.930
<b>[gasps] Saki!</b>

14:52.010 --> 14:55.060
<b>-[shimmering sound]
-[whooshing]</b>

14:56.640 --> 14:58.180
<b>[Saki groaning]</b>

15:06.820 --> 15:08.190
<b>-[grunts]
-[yelps]</b>

15:10.530 --> 15:12.950
<b>[ethereal music plays]</b>

15:15.280 --> 15:17.410
<b>Neither of us
is strong enough to beat her.</b>

15:17.490 --> 15:18.830
<b>What do we do, Yassan?</b>

15:19.960 --> 15:21.330
<b>We beat her together.</b>

15:23.460 --> 15:24.420
<b>Together.</b>

15:24.500 --> 15:25.920
<b>-[whooshing]
-[gasps]</b>

15:29.210 --> 15:30.760
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

15:30.840 --> 15:35.390
<b>[shimmering bursts]</b>

15:36.470 --> 15:38.390
<b>[warm, upbeat electronic music plays]</b>

15:39.890 --> 15:41.560
<b>[pulsing whoosh]</b>

15:43.150 --> 15:44.940
<b>[Yasuke grunting]</b>

15:48.400 --> 15:49.530
<b>[shouts]</b>

15:53.410 --> 15:55.410
<b>[Yasuke grunting]</b>

16:03.170 --> 16:04.500
<b>[exhales]</b>

16:06.170 --> 16:07.210
<b>[yelling]</b>

16:07.290 --> 16:08.840
<b>[shimmering pulse]</b>

16:08.920 --> 16:10.670
<b>[otherworldly clashing]</b>

16:16.970 --> 16:18.060
<b>Enough!</b>

16:20.850 --> 16:22.140
<b>[whirring]</b>

16:22.230 --> 16:24.270
<b>[pulsing blasts]</b>

16:24.350 --> 16:26.440
<b>-[Saki screams]
-[Yasuke grunts]</b>

16:29.610 --> 16:31.030
<b>[groaning]</b>

16:33.110 --> 16:34.780
<b>[rumbling]</b>

16:35.990 --> 16:37.160
<b>[snarls]</b>

16:41.120 --> 16:42.750
<b>[roars]</b>

16:47.710 --> 16:49.090
<b>[boom]</b>

16:52.920 --> 16:53.920
<b>[roars]</b>

16:57.850 --> 16:58.680
<b>[gasps]</b>

17:00.600 --> 17:02.020
<b>[grunts]</b>

17:03.180 --> 17:04.940
<b>[diminishing, pulsing sound]</b>

17:05.020 --> 17:07.400
<b>[rumbling steps approaching]</b>

17:10.270 --> 17:12.530
<b>You earned your payment, Shaman.</b>

17:13.280 --> 17:15.700
<b>Too bad I can't take it with me.</b>

17:17.530 --> 17:19.410
<b>If we must give our lives,</b>

17:19.490 --> 17:23.910
<b>then we do so proudly
in the temple of our ancestors.</b>

17:24.750 --> 17:27.170
<b>[mellow music playing]</b>

17:27.250 --> 17:29.590
<b>[Daimyo] I cannot understand it.</b>

17:29.670 --> 17:32.800
<b>The insistence
in believing these illusions,</b>

17:32.880 --> 17:37.510
<b>when the true relation of nature
remains what it has always been.</b>

17:37.590 --> 17:39.140
<b>Power.</b>

17:39.220 --> 17:42.810
<b>I will make the girl's power my own.</b>

17:42.890 --> 17:44.140
<b>[pulsing sound]</b>

17:44.220 --> 17:45.060
<b>[shouts]</b>

17:45.140 --> 17:46.560
<b>[sustained blasting]</b>

17:48.480 --> 17:50.810
<b>[grunts softly]</b>

17:51.610 --> 17:53.610
<b>[straining]</b>

17:57.030 --> 17:58.570
<b>[shouts]</b>

17:58.660 --> 18:00.570
<b>[pulsing whooshing]</b>

18:04.910 --> 18:06.580
<b>[Daimyo shouts]</b>

18:07.290 --> 18:08.580
<b>[groans, coughs]</b>

18:08.670 --> 18:10.670
<b>[retches, coughs]</b>

18:11.170 --> 18:14.840
<b>[whooshing]</b>

18:14.920 --> 18:17.840
<b>[somber music plays]</b>

18:17.930 --> 18:19.840
<b>[distant whooshing]</b>

18:22.430 --> 18:24.850
<b>[pulsing hum]</b>

18:32.190 --> 18:33.860
<b>[laughing maniacally]</b>

18:39.400 --> 18:41.410
<b>[echoing laughter continues]</b>

18:42.870 --> 18:44.280
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

18:52.040 --> 18:56.260
<b>[shimmering sound intensifies]</b>

18:58.090 --> 18:59.220
<b>[Daimyo gasps]</b>

19:00.180 --> 19:01.970
<b>[crackling]</b>

19:03.510 --> 19:06.850
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

19:23.700 --> 19:25.330
<b>[bright shimmering pulse]</b>

19:26.410 --> 19:29.330
<b>[groaning] So this is how it feels…</b>

19:30.120 --> 19:31.460
<b>Change.</b>

19:33.290 --> 19:34.420
<b>[fizzling]</b>

19:45.930 --> 19:47.930
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

19:50.390 --> 19:52.190
<b>Does this mean we won?</b>

19:52.690 --> 19:55.520
<b>The monster was created
by the Daimyo's power.</b>

19:55.610 --> 19:59.820
<b>It could only have been destroyed
if that power is no more.</b>

20:01.070 --> 20:02.110
<b>We won!</b>

20:02.990 --> 20:03.820
<b>[chuckles]</b>

20:03.910 --> 20:05.780
<b>[yelling] We won!</b>

20:05.870 --> 20:06.830
<b>We won!</b>

20:06.910 --> 20:08.620
<b>Yeah!</b>

20:08.700 --> 20:09.790
<b>-Whoo!
-Whoo!</b>

20:09.870 --> 20:13.580
<b>[all cheering, laughing]</b>

20:14.170 --> 20:15.380
<b>Perhaps.</b>

20:15.460 --> 20:18.090
<b>But if this is victory, what is the cost?</b>

20:29.850 --> 20:32.520
<b>Yassan, we did it. We beat her!</b>

20:33.810 --> 20:34.730
<b>Yassan?</b>

20:38.150 --> 20:39.020
<b>Yassan!</b>

20:40.650 --> 20:42.650
<b>[jangling]</b>

20:54.920 --> 20:58.340
<b>[sobbing heavily]</b>

21:06.720 --> 21:10.220
<b>[soft shimmering sound]</b>

21:12.850 --> 21:14.850
<b>[bright shimmering sound]</b>

21:16.600 --> 21:18.980
<b>[pulsating shimmering notes]</b>

21:27.070 --> 21:28.820
<b>-[inhales sharply]
-[Saki gasps]</b>

21:30.330 --> 21:31.370
<b>[grunts]</b>

21:33.450 --> 21:35.250
<b>[sighs] What happened?</b>

21:35.330 --> 21:36.670
<b>You saved me.</b>

21:38.130 --> 21:40.500
<b>We do that for each other kind of a lot.</b>

21:42.210 --> 21:43.260
<b>The Daimyo…</b>

21:48.340 --> 21:49.430
<b>You're standing.</b>

21:49.510 --> 21:51.010
<b>You aren't sick anymore.</b>

21:51.100 --> 21:52.470
<b>Yeah, you're right.</b>

21:52.560 --> 21:54.470
<b>I feel better somehow.</b>

21:54.560 --> 21:56.940
<b>[hesitates] More balanced.</b>

21:57.020 --> 21:58.520
<b>[Daimyo, weakly] Not for long.</b>

21:58.600 --> 22:02.020
<b>[rasping, breathless]
Soon you will want more and more.</b>

22:02.110 --> 22:06.530
<b>So much that it will take a whole world
to sustain you.</b>

22:06.610 --> 22:08.570
<b>No, I'm not like you.</b>

22:09.070 --> 22:10.280
<b>I have friends.</b>

22:10.870 --> 22:14.660
<b>My body… Flames rage inside it.</b>

22:15.160 --> 22:19.080
<b>Samurai, dispatch me quickly
from this realm.</b>

22:19.170 --> 22:21.920
<b>The people you tormented
will decide your fate.</b>

22:25.550 --> 22:27.260
<b>[groans weakly]</b>

22:32.640 --> 22:34.350
<b>[man 1] Collect all their weapons.</b>

22:34.430 --> 22:37.520
<b>-[man 2] Check those knots.
-[man 1] You, get more bandages.</b>

22:37.600 --> 22:38.980
<b>[man 2] No one is safe.</b>

22:40.520 --> 22:42.440
<b>[men panting]</b>

22:44.150 --> 22:46.570
<b>-[man 3] I'm on my way!
-[man 4] Let's move this.</b>

22:46.650 --> 22:49.150
<b>[man 5] You, come on.
Right here. Get me some help.</b>

22:49.240 --> 22:50.570
<b>[man 3] Where's the medic?</b>

22:51.160 --> 22:52.570
<b>[Saki] Morisuke!</b>

22:52.660 --> 22:54.080
<b>[running footsteps]</b>

22:54.660 --> 22:56.330
<b>[panting, grunts]</b>

22:56.410 --> 22:58.500
<b>Saki, I thought you…</b>

22:59.790 --> 23:01.380
<b>So, you did it, then.</b>

23:01.460 --> 23:02.960
<b>You truly defeated her.</b>

23:03.040 --> 23:05.210
<b>No. We did.</b>

23:08.420 --> 23:09.470
<b>[chuckles softly]</b>

23:11.930 --> 23:15.100
<b>Ah. Finally been paid, I see, Achoja.</b>

23:15.180 --> 23:18.350
<b>[chuckles] I guess
I owe you some kind of thanks.</b>

23:18.430 --> 23:21.730
<b>This is the most successful job
I have ever done.</b>

23:21.810 --> 23:24.110
<b>[all laughing]</b>

23:24.190 --> 23:26.360
<b>[Achoja grunting happily]</b>

23:27.530 --> 23:29.610
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

23:30.650 --> 23:33.870
<b>[sighs] I don't know.
Are you sure we should've come back?</b>

23:34.370 --> 23:35.410
<b>It's your home.</b>

23:37.370 --> 23:38.700
<b>[Saki] Where is everyone?</b>

23:41.080 --> 23:42.170
<b>Hmm?</b>

23:42.250 --> 23:44.880
<b>It's all right, everyone.
It's Saki and the boatsman.</b>

23:44.960 --> 23:47.380
<b>-They've come back.
-[overlapping murmurs]</b>

23:47.460 --> 23:49.170
<b>Sorry about the greeting.</b>

23:49.260 --> 23:52.180
<b>We've been getting visits
from some of the Daimyo's old units,</b>

23:52.260 --> 23:53.720
<b>trying to jockey for power.</b>

23:53.800 --> 23:56.220
<b>But we showed them where to go!</b>

23:56.300 --> 23:57.140
<b>[laughter]</b>

23:57.220 --> 23:59.930
<b>We heard it was you
that took down the Daimyo.</b>

24:00.020 --> 24:02.350
<b>Never been prouder of one of our own!</b>

24:02.440 --> 24:04.810
<b>One of… your own?</b>

24:04.900 --> 24:07.270
<b>You got a fruit tree for life at my stand!</b>

24:07.360 --> 24:09.860
<b>As long as you don't blow it up again.</b>

24:09.940 --> 24:11.530
<b>You're a badass, Saki!</b>

24:11.610 --> 24:13.910
<b>How'd you do it? Was it like, "Bam"?</b>

24:13.990 --> 24:15.990
<b>Or was it like, "Ka-thunka-boom"?</b>

24:22.330 --> 24:26.130
<b>What? You knock me unconscious
with one psychic blast</b>

24:26.210 --> 24:28.550
<b>and suddenly we're not friends anymore?</b>

24:28.630 --> 24:29.550
<b>[chuckles softly]</b>

24:31.840 --> 24:33.550
<b>[sighs, laughing]</b>

24:34.760 --> 24:36.970
<b>I was sure you would hate me forever!</b>

24:37.050 --> 24:38.600
<b>Ichi told us what happened.</b>

24:38.680 --> 24:41.770
<b>We owe you so much
for what you did for this land.</b>

24:41.850 --> 24:42.810
<b>We all do.</b>

24:43.390 --> 24:44.810
<b>Come on, Dad. Ask her!</b>

24:45.730 --> 24:46.730
<b>[clears throat]</b>

24:46.810 --> 24:50.820
<b>If you need a place to stay,
we would be honored if you would--</b>

24:50.900 --> 24:52.820
<b>[gasps] Really?</b>

24:52.900 --> 24:53.900
<b>Yes!</b>

24:53.990 --> 24:55.490
<b>-Oh!
-[Saki sighs]</b>

24:55.570 --> 24:57.370
<b>So that means you're back?</b>

24:57.870 --> 24:59.280
<b>It was never my home.</b>

25:00.080 --> 25:01.330
<b>It was my retreat.</b>

25:01.950 --> 25:03.620
<b>One which I no longer need.</b>

25:06.370 --> 25:09.590
<b>I suppose I could stay
a little bit longer. [chuckles]</b>

25:10.170 --> 25:12.170
<b>Just until your training is finished.</b>

25:12.760 --> 25:14.090
<b>I almost forgot!</b>

25:16.720 --> 25:19.720
<b>-Saki, I--
-She would want you to have it.</b>

25:20.310 --> 25:21.720
<b>It was your mother's.</b>

25:21.810 --> 25:24.480
<b>You could come bring it
back to me, when I'm older.</b>

25:30.730 --> 25:31.730
<b>[chuckles softly]</b>

25:32.530 --> 25:34.860
<b>Come on, Saki!
Let me show you my new toys!</b>

25:34.950 --> 25:37.700
<b>People give you so much stuff
when you almost die!</b>

25:38.410 --> 25:39.320
<b>[chuckles]</b>

25:42.200 --> 25:45.120
<b>-[Ichiro] Yeah, seriously, come on!
-[chuckling]</b>

25:53.260 --> 25:54.090
<b>[jangles]</b>

25:58.640 --> 26:00.640
<b>[mellow music playing]</b>

26:29.580 --> 26:31.590
<b>[dramatic music plays]</b>

27:18.840 --> 27:20.840
<b>[music softens]</b>

27:31.350 --> 27:33.360
<b>[music fades]</b>

27:36.900 --> 27:38.780
<b>[crickets chirping]</b>

27:38.860 --> 27:40.740
<b>-[bird calling]
-[serene music plays]</b>

27:40.820 --> 27:42.990
<b>MARU</b>

27:48.080 --> 27:49.870
<b>[footsteps approach]</b>

27:53.830 --> 27:55.500
<b>I remember you.</b>

27:55.590 --> 28:00.380
<b>You are the African who protected me
from Ota Gyuichi that day on the docks.</b>

28:00.470 --> 28:03.010
<b>It all seems so long ago.</b>

28:03.090 --> 28:04.680
<b>[sighs] I guess that it was.</b>

28:04.760 --> 28:05.760
<b>NATSUMARU</b>

28:05.850 --> 28:09.430
<b>Was it also you who sent my family
the chest of Nobunaga's gold?</b>

28:09.520 --> 28:12.480
<b>I always thought it must have been you.</b>

28:12.560 --> 28:15.400
<b>You were the only one
she spoke of as a friend.</b>

28:17.400 --> 28:21.360
<b>[Yasuke] There was something else.
Something I should have given you then.</b>

28:25.320 --> 28:26.660
<b>If you have this,</b>

28:27.450 --> 28:28.660
<b>does that mean…</b>

28:29.450 --> 28:32.160
<b>W-- Were you with her, at the end?</b>

28:32.250 --> 28:33.620
<b>Tell me.</b>

28:34.670 --> 28:36.000
<b>[shakily] How did she die?</b>

28:37.290 --> 28:39.050
<b>[quavering] She died with honor.</b>

28:39.670 --> 28:41.720
<b>She died fighting for her clan.</b>

28:44.380 --> 28:45.720
<b>[sighs, sniffles]</b>

28:47.100 --> 28:48.720
<b>Thank you for returning--</b>

28:48.810 --> 28:50.310
<b>Uh… Huh?</b>

28:59.650 --> 29:03.070
<b>-[birds chirping]
-[uplifting melodic music playing]</b>

29:12.160 --> 29:13.580
<b>[jangles]</b>

29:18.040 --> 29:20.460
<b>[music swells passionately]</b>

29:20.550 --> 29:22.550
<b>[music fades]</b>
